# Diabolic Intent: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature" - one Bot1 controls. With no creature of
# its own (Bot2's Ornithopter cannot be sacrificed by Bot1) an attempted cast cannot pay and reverses its mana abilities;
# once Bot1 casts its own Ornithopter the same Diabolic Intent is castable (the positive control), and finds nothing when
# Bot1 answers the search with no card (CR 701.23b): the Ornithopter is gone all the same.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Diabolic Intent
Swamp x3
Swamp
Mox Pearl
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Diabolic Intent.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
? Bot1.Hand = Diabolic Intent; Ornithopter; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp
? Bot1.Mana =
? Bot1.Life = 20
? Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Mox Jet
? Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
? Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Diabolic Intent.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Search(Mox Pearl)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Mox Jet
Bot1.Hand = Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Mox Pearl
Bot1.Graveyard = Diabolic Intent; Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
